Depends: amneziageo (= @VERSION@), libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1, @ICU@, libssl3t64 | libssl3 | libssl1.1
Description: geo-aware VPN client - desktop interface
 AmneziaGeo sends only the traffic named by geo rules through an AmneziaWG
 tunnel and leaves the rest on the direct link.
 .
 This package carries the desktop interface. It runs as the desktop user and
 drives the agent from the amneziageo package over its control socket, so a
 server without a graphical session does not need it.
